s's instance, nil for anything else; the instance stays the"] [1940 1 "// dict's self for __dict__'s getter."] [1954 1 "// sharedDictDescr and sharedWeakrefDescr are 3.15's descriptors of a class's __dict__ and __weakref__, one each"] [1955 1 "// shared by every class that adds them (typeobject.c's interpreter-wide subtype_dict and subtype_getweakref"] [1956 1 "// descriptors, gh-135228; queue 237): object's, so an object without the slot is refused by the getter"] [1974 1 "// hasGC is HAVE_GC, tp_free's choice: a class that adds nothing to a base without it has none."] [1987 1 "// compatibleWithBase is compatible_with_tp_base. A built-in type: the exceptions that add no fields to theirs."] [2008 1 "// sameSlotsAdded is same_slots_added."] [2025 1 "// managedLayout is the flags compatible_for_assignment compares: Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT, MANAGED_WEAKREF (the"] [2026 1 "// preheader: a class's own or inherited __dict__ and __weakref__, not a built-in type's) and INLINE_VALUES."] [2040 1 "// compatibleForAssignment is compatible_for_assignment."] [2060 1 "// objectSetClass is object_set_class."] [2093 1 "// slotsOf is the slot values of an object with __slots__ (an instance, a module subclass's), nil for none."] [2104 1 "// checkClassCells is type_new_set_classcell and type_new_set_classdictcell."] [2125 1 "// fullyQualified is _PyType_GetFullyQualifiedName (%T): the qualified name, without the module for builtins and __main__."] [2133 1 "// reprOrName is repr(o), or its type's name when repr fails."] [2141 1 "// mroInternal is mro_internal: the metaclass's mro() when it overrides type's, checked (mro_check), else C3. An"] [2142 1 "// inner call that already set the MRO (a reentrant mro()) wins: done false."] [2178 14 "// the type attribute cache: an MRO set"] [2182 1 "// sameMRO is the same list, not an equal one (CPython compares the tuple's identity)."] [2192 1 "// mroHierarchy is mro_hierarchy: t's MRO and its subclasses' computed again, the old ones kept in undo.